// Fun queue 2, item 34: the seasons' fixed places, and the frost heaves. The lists between the markers are made by
// tools/seasons/gen.mjs from the real world (flat dry ground, clear of walls and of the paved road); the game reads them and
// never re-derives them, so every browser puts the same stand, pull-off and sailboat in the same place.

